<title>JAPAN: Toyo Communication - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Communication - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 40.61		vs	   42.23</p>
<p> Operating	    2.16		vs	    2.75</p>
<p> Current		2.20		vs	    2.99</p>
<p> Net		  962    million    vs	    1.67</p>
<p> EPS		   17.11 yen	  vs	   29.62 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     56 million	  vs	  56 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toyo Communication Equipment Co Ltd makes communications equipment and belongs to the NEC group.</p>
